      "content": "hey, following up on what you said earlier... you're totally right, it really does feel like an infestation! the way these redundancies just hang out in the shadows of the schema and pop up when you least expect it is so frustrating. \n\nsince you mentioned those little guys lurking around, can you help me figure out a \"slay\" strategy? like, what's the best way to go on a hunt through the tables to find and evict these little data nuisances once and for all so they don't come back and mess with the integrity again?",
